  "title": "Fox Corporation President and Chief Operating Officer John Nallen to Participate in MoffettNathanson’s Media, Internet & Communications Conference 2026",
  "summary": "New York, NY and Los Angeles, CA – May 6, 2026 – Fox Corporation (Nasdaq: FOXA, FOX) today announced that President and Chief Operating Officer John Nallen will participate in MoffettNathanson’s Media, Internet & Communications Conference 2026 on Wednesday, May 13, at approximately 10:30am (Eastern), 7:30am (Pacific). A live and archived webcast of the presentation […]",
